  "identityStatus": "The named native church outline fixes the cruciform walls and rounded architectural projections. A separate South African National Geo-spatial Information survey marker records the spire at 161.6 m elevation. The mapped Andrew Murray Memorial and Church Street corroborate the front elevation.",
